ation is to give the user a comprehensive and accurate overview of discovered exoplanets. View all discovered planets in the milky way. The application shows a 3D simulation of each solar system.\n\nData provided by PHL's Exoplanet Catalog of the Planetary Habitability Laboratory", "short_description": "View all discovered exoplanets. The application shows a simulation of each solar system."}]}, "developer_name": "G\u00f6ran B\u00e4cklund", "developer_privacy_policy_url": null, "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Exoplanethunter", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://exoplanethunter.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "EXPLORATION", "SPACE_UNIVERSE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "453311289670868"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1417144575107196"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1417144575107196"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1572541240, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1417144575107196"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2332651630180940", "version": "0.2"}, "id": "2439859526301220", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2117987304980708", "is_concept": false, "latest_released